  "ja16:1.1": "miganti pallatthamanekamāyaṃ ",
  "ja16:1.2": "aṭṭhakhuraṃ aḍḍharattāvapāyiṃ, ",
  "ja16:1.3": "ekena sotena chamāssasanto ",
  "ja16:1.4": "chahi kalāhatibhoti bhāgineyyoti. ",
